{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清涼從〈法界品〉「爾時文殊從善住樓閣出」已下\n為流通分。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九會\n〈離世間品〉明果後利生之常道，而通為設法治習修證分也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清涼以初會六品為舉果勸樂生信分，二會至七會三十一品為修\n因契果生解分，〈離世間〉一品為托法進修成行分。〈法界〉一品為衣人證入成德分。通以信解行證四字判\n盡一藏。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計五卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前〈普賢三昧品〉共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計三卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前〈佛名號品〉共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前〈光明覺品〉共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與〈賢首品〉上卷共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計二卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前二品共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前〈梵行品〉共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品\n計一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "。此二品與\n〈十行品〉上卷共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品\n計二卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與〈迴向品〉初卷共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計十一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計六卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品梵文未來。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計四卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前〈十通品〉共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前二品共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計二卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品與前〈十身相海品〉共一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此品計三卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此〈離世間品〉計七卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此〈入法界品〉計二十一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0458001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0458001", "type": "orig", "text": "以疑次"}
{"id": null, "n": "0466001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0466001", "type": "orig", "text": "時疑得"}
